    "intro": {
      "type": "snh-biz-copy",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Trade supply",
        "heading": "Your wholesale *supplement* partner in Sri Lanka",
        "body": "<p>Sports Nutrition Hub supplies gyms, supplement stores, pharmacies, coaches and teams across Sri Lanka with the same authentic products we sell in our own stores. Every tub is sourced directly from the brand or its authorised distributor, so you never have to explain a grey-market label or a missing batch code to your customers.</p><p>Whether you need <strong>bulk whey protein</strong> for a gym shop, <strong>creatine wholesale in Colombo</strong> for a busy counter, or a steady supply of electrolytes and gels for an endurance team, one account covers it. You get a single price list, one point of contact and stock that ships from Colombo to every district.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/khizerinsid.webp",
        "image_alt": "Inside an SNH store with shelves of whey protein and creatine",
        "style": "white"
      }
    },
