    "why": {
      "type": "snh-biz-copy",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Why SNH",
        "heading": "Authentic stock you can *stand behind*",
        "body": "<p>Counterfeit and parallel-imported supplements are a real problem in Sri Lanka. They damage trust in your business the moment a customer spots a wrong label or a suspicious taste. As the <strong>official Science in Sport distributor</strong> and a direct partner of leading protein and creatine brands, SNH gives you a supply chain you can explain to any customer.</p><p>Our three Colombo stores sell these products every day, so we know what moves, which flavours sell out and what athletes ask for next. That knowledge comes with your account: we will tell you what to stock for a gym in Kandy, a pharmacy in Galle or a team in Jaffna, not just send a catalogue.</p><p>Want to see us first? Visit one of our <a href=\"/#stores\">SNH stores</a>, or read about <a href=\"/pages/snh-elite\">SNH Elite</a>, the loyalty club your customers may already belong to.</p>",
        "style": "cream"
      }
    },
    "form": {
      "type": "snh-biz-form",
      "settings": {
        "kind": "wholesale",
        "eyebrow": "Wholesale application",
        "heading": "Apply for a *wholesale* account",
        "intro": "<p>Tell us about your business and what you would like to stock. We reply within one working day with next steps and a price list for approved accounts.</p>",
        "point_1": "No obligation and no fee to apply",
        "point_2": "A reply within one working day",
        "point_3": "Trade prices for approved accounts",
        "submit": "Send wholesale enquiry",
        "ok_heading": "Thank you, your wholesale enquiry is in",
        "ok_text": "<p>Here is what happens next:</p><ul><li>Our wholesale team reviews your details, usually within one working day.</li><li>If we are a good fit, we send your trade price list and confirm your account terms.</li><li>Need it sooner? WhatsApp us and mention your business name.</li></ul>",
        "ok_label": "Browse the range",
        "msg_placeholder": "Order frequency, delivery location or anything else we should know"
      }
    },
    "faq": {
      "type": "snh-faq",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Wholesale FAQ",
        "heading": "Wholesale *questions*",
        "lead": "Call or WhatsApp [whatsapp] for anything not covered here.",
        "show_cta": true,
        "cta": "Talk to the wholesale team",
        "style": "dark"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is there a minimum order for wholesale?",
            "answer": "<p>Minimum order quantities depend on the brand and your business type. We confirm the minimums for your account with your price list, and keep them realistic for smaller gyms and new stores.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you deliver wholesale orders outside Colombo?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. We deliver island-wide. Colombo orders can often go out the same day when stock allows, and other districts usually arrive in one to three working days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What payment terms do you offer?",
            "answer": "<p>New accounts pay on order by bank transfer. Credit terms are available for approved partners with an established order history, and we confirm them in writing.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are your products authentic?",
            "answer": "<p>Every product comes directly from the brand or its authorised distributor. SNH is the official Science in Sport distributor in Sri Lanka, and each order can be traced by batch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I get the wholesale price list?",
            "answer": "<p>Send the application form on this page. Once your details are checked, we email the trade price list for the categories you chose.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I order mixed brands and flavours?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. One account covers every brand we carry, so you can mix whey, creatine, hydration and accessories in a single order.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
